meta {
  name: 01 Purchase add-on
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/entitlements/purchase
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
  Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "product": "AI_SPEAKING_CREDIT",
    "quantity": 10
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.getStatus() === 201) {
    bru.setEnvVar("paymentId", res.getBody().id);
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 201
  res.body.status: eq PENDING
  res.body.kind: eq AI_SPEAKING_CREDIT
  res.body.quantity: eq 10
  res.body.unitPriceXaf: eq 300
}

docs {
  Records intent to buy an add-on. Grants nothing until the webhook.

  Run `Center Auth / 03 Login` first. Center should be ACTIVE (or at least
  able to pay). Change `{{idempotencyKey}}` for each new purchase.

  ## Products to smoke (launch)

  | product | unitPriceXaf (HT) | body example |
  |---------| | ----------------- | ------------ |
  | PREP_PASS | 1000 | `{"product":"PREP_PASS","quantity":1}` |
  | AI_SPEAKING_CREDIT | 300 | `{"product":"AI_SPEAKING_CREDIT","quantity":10}` |
  | AI_SCHREIBEN_CREDIT | 200 | see `04 Purchase Schreiben credits` |

  `amountXaf` on the response is **TTC** (HT × 1.18).

  Do **not** smoke-sell AI_ASSISTED_LEARNING / Exam Day IA in production UI.

  ## Next steps

  1. `Center Payments / 05 Start checkout` (same `paymentId`)
  2. `Center Payments / 06 Simulate provider webhook` (local fake)
  3. Assign: `PUT /api/centers/me/codes/{codeId}/entitlements/PREP_PASS`
     (body depends on product — Prep Pass grants 30 days from assign)
  4. Student: `GET /api/me/entitlements`

  Same Idempotency-Key twice → same payment id. Different body → 409.
}
